igin:initial;background-clip:initial;'\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:;\">60-90mins / class</span>"], "授業計画1": "<span style=\"font-family:Times,serif;font-size:10pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">Course sessions may change depending on the needs of the class.<br /><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">Students are required join actively and engage in communicative pair and group work.&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">Students are expected to complete all assignments even if they are absent from thew face-to-face class.</span></span>", "授業外学習2": "<span times=\"times\" new=\"new\" roman\",serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\"=\"roman',serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;'\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:;\">Students are expected to do 60-90 minutes of outside study outside per class session.</span>"}, "評価": {"教科書/Required texts0": ["No textbook. Learning materials will be provided by the instructor."], "学位授与の方針との関連Relationship to Diploma Policy0": ["Each subject is placed on the curriculum based on the Diploma Policy (DP) and Curriculum Policy (CP) established by each faculty and graduate school. \nBy studying this subject with the DP and CP in mind, you will develop the abilities expected by each faculty and graduate school. \nThe DP, CP and curriculum table (list of subjects, etc.) of each faculty and graduate school are posted in the link below, so please use it as a reference for your study plan. \nhttps://kwic.kwansei.ac.jp/cabinet/reference?typeCd=0&amp;cabinetId=557&amp;directLink=1 \n*This is a link to kwic (only current students can view it)"], "学位授与の方針との関連Relationship to Diploma Policy1": ["Feedback on assignments will be given in class and through assessment feedback from the instructor via the LMS."], "成績評価Grading0": ["種別　Type備考　Note", "割合　Percentage", "評価基準等　Grading Criteria etc."], "成績評価Grading1": ["その他／Others (99)", "100 %", "Final Project 40%, Final Project Report 10%, Discussions &amp; mini-projects 20%, Midterm Project 20%, Participation 10%"], "成績評価Grading2": ["備考　Note 40% Final Project10% Final Project Report20% Discussions &amp; mini-projects20% Midterm Project10% Participation&nbsp;(Including but not limited to: attitude, behaviour, appropriate use of smartphones &amp; other devices, not speaking Japanese in class, preparedness for class, volunteering answers, group work participation)出席、遅刻の制度については以下URL先をご確認ください。/ Please refer to the following URL for details regarding the attendance and tardiness policy.https://kwic.kwansei.ac.jp/cabinet/area/detail?areaId=7144&amp;directLink=1"], "備考Note0": ["To take this class, you must apply for level certification in advance. For details, please check the \"Course Registration Procedures\" at the following URL (KWIC Cabinet)."], "備考Note1": ["英語インテンシブ・プログラム　履修について"], "備考Note2": ["2026年09月04日 16時13分20秒"], "項番No.0": [], "項番No.1": ["2026年度", "秋学期／Fall", "月曜３時限／Monday 3", "秋学期／Fall", "４別－２０１"]}, "campas": 0, "name": "【300】Culture and Society　１３／Culture and Society", "管理部署": 20, "単位数": 2, "担当者": "タウンゼンド・Ｎ　Ｌ（TOWNSEND-NAKAI LEON） ", "履修基準年度": "１年", "履修登録方法": "申込制(他条件あり)", "緊急授業形態": 0, "開講期": 2, "時限1": 2, "時限1_term": 1, "評価1": 6, "成績評価備考": "備考　Note\n40% Final Project\n10% Final Project Report\n20% Discussions & mini-projects\n20% Midterm Project\n10% Participation (Including but not limited to: attitude, behaviour, appropriate use of smartphones & other devices, not speaking Japanese in class, preparedness for class, volunteering answers, group work participation)\n\n\n出席、遅刻の制度については以下URL先をご確認ください。/ Please refer to the following URL for details regarding the attendance and tardiness policy.\nhttps://kwic.kwansei.ac.jp/cabinet/area/detail?areaId=7144&directLink=1"}